<center>
  <h1>Book I</h1>
</center>

<p>
  <i>Milestone 1 scaffold stub.</i> Full conversion of Book I's intro page —
  with definitions, postulates, common notions, and the proposition table of
  contents — is tracked as the next milestone in the lektor repo.
</p>

<p>
  Converted so far:
</p>

<ul>
  <li><a href="propI1/">Proposition 1</a> &mdash; To construct an equilateral triangle on a given finite straight line.</li>
  <li><a href="propI4/">Proposition 4</a> (stub)</li>
</ul>

<p>
  Reference: <a href="https://www.euclids-elements.org/elements/bookI/bookI.html">the
  hand-authored Book I intro on euclids-elements.org</a>.
</p>
